'''Blinky Kory''' (ブリンキーコアラッキョ, ''Burinkī Koarakkyo'', '''Blinky Koalakkyo''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Blinky Kory
|image = E 782.png
|first appearance = [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 900¢ - 3,555¢
}}

==Enemy==
Essentially a slightly stronger [[Kory]] with the Red trait, a longer [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Wave]] instead of a standard Wave Attack and a 50% chance to [[Slow]] units.

==Strategy==
The damage from its Mini-Waves is very low, which means many sturdy attackers/crowd-controllers like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] can simply brute-force their way through. A [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] is recommended at higher magnifications, as it begins dealing noticeably higher damage that can stunlock some of your cats. In particular, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can take advantage of the Mini-Waves' low damage to repeatedly rebound onto enemies, which can be very good for bursting down specific threats.

Outside of this, standard [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave-Immune units]] like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] and [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]] get the job done well enough.

